WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.825
Fundraising software that doesn't live in your Salesforce org.

2
00:00:07.817 --> 00:00:10.858
Your donation platform holds the donors.

3
00:00:10.858 --> 00:00:13.367
Salesforce gets a copy overnight.

4
00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:17.644
Pledgivo removes the second system.

5
00:00:17.644 --> 00:00:18.290
One org.

6
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.067
One copy of the truth.

7
00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:24.233
A public donation form, backed by Stripe.

8
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.383
The gift lands as a standard Opportunity.

9
00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:32.908
Salesforce owns the schedule and charges the saved card itself.

10
00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:39.008
Ticketed events, tiered pricing, real seat capacity.

11
00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:46.258
Two lines of HTML put a live campaign on any site you own.

12
00:00:47.883 --> 00:00:48.506
Pledgivo.

13
00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:51.758
Keep your donors where your data already lives.

